        } else {
            newDay = new Date(newDay.valueOf() - 24*60*60*1000);
        }
    }
    this.setDate(newDay);
},

But note that setDate will again apply min/max, possibly moving date back if out of bounds; but we already bounded.

Alternatively we could just call this.setDate(newDay) after loop; setDate will enforce min/max again but that's fine.

